Step 1. Convert YOLO format into COCO format:
  using YOLO2COCO ultility: https://github.com/thinhdoanvu/Image-Classification/blob/main/Utility/yolo2coco.py

Step 2. Create folders:
  mmdetection
    |__data
    |____annotations
    |______instances_train2017.json
    |______instances_val2017.json
    |____train2017
    |______images.jpg (all images)
    |____val2017
    |______images.jpg (all images)

Step 2': Or using another structure
mmdetection
    |__data
    |____annotations
    |______instances_train2017.json
    |______instances_val2017.json
    |______instances_test2017.json
    |____images
    |______images.jpg (all images: 18,768 pics)
    

Step 3. Create config.py inside config folder
    mmdetection
    |__config
    |____config.py
